  volume={},
  number={},
  pages={1-3},
  abstract={This year, I had the distinct honor of serving as Industry Track Program Chair for ISCA 2026. Since its launch in 2020, the ACM/IEEE International Symposium on Computer Architecture (ISCA) Industry Track has emerged as a premier venue for showcasing impactful, real-world innovation from industry. To qualify, the first author—and the majority of contributors—must come from industry, ensuring the track remains grounded in practice. Submissions have spanned commercial products, exploratory or canceled silicon tape.outs, and software.centric efforts of deep relevance to the ISCA community, including datacenter software, compilers, and accelerator stacks. All submissions reflect authentic industry experience at production scale—whether retrospective analyses, forward-looking roadmap plans, or candid examinations of ambitious efforts that never reached deployment.},
